The '''Ottelic languages''' are [[MAIN LANG FAMILY languages]] spoken primarily by the [[Ottelic peoples]] and their descendants. They all directly descent from the [[Ottelian language]], spoken by the [[Ottelians]]. 

The Ottelic languages are divided into four geographic groups: [[North Ottelic languages|North]], [[South Ottelic languages|South]], [[East Ottelic languages|East]], and [[West Ottelic languages|West]]. Together, they comprise around NUM languages. 

